category: Libs
requires: cygwin libfreetype6 libgcc1 libintl8 libQt5Core5 libQt5Gui5 libSDL2_2.0_0 libstdc++6 libX11_6 libXaw7 libXt6
sdesc: "Open Source 3D Graphics Engine (runtime)"
ldesc: "OGRE (Object-Oriented Graphics Rendering Engine) is a
scene-oriented, flexible 3D engine written in C++ designed to make it easier
and more intuitive for developers to produce games and demos utilising 3D
hardware. The class library abstracts all the details of using the underlying
system libraries like Direct3D and OpenGL and provides an interface based on
world objects and other intuitive classes."
external-source: ogre

